-- GF/lib/src/albanian/LexiconSqi.gf
-- Completed standard RGL lexicon for Albanian.
-- Lemmas use the Albanian citation form expected by ParadigmsSqi:
-- N = indefinite nominative singular; V = present 1sg where regular.

